# The thinking map of the gemini-cli AgentHarness (docs/adr/0040 §2):
# what a role's THINKING (low|medium|high, plan §5) becomes in the
# generated settings.json. The harness runs Gemini only until M19, so
# one provider. Read by adapters/gemini-cli/run.sh; a missing line is a
# refusal naming this file and the key.
#
# Gemini CLI: generateContentConfig.thinkingConfig.thinkingLevel on the
# model alias, an upper-case enum (docs/adr/0017 §3's verified facts;
# live since docs/adr/0018's run, 2026-09-16); the Gemini API behind it
# accepts low|medium|high on gemini-3.8-flash (AI Studio docs,
# "Thinking", https://aistudio.google.com/docs/thinking, read 2026-11-03).
GEMINI_LOW=LOW
GEMINI_MEDIUM=MEDIUM
GEMINI_HIGH=HIGH
